{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298230/extras/The_Grappler_Promo_Gif.gif?t=1743548403\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Demo does not contain all game features. First trailer showcases full game features, second showcases demo</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Grapple</strong> or<strong> Fall</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Grappler</strong> is  a test of patience, precision, and perseverance. Inspired by brutally challenging platformers like <i>Jump King</i> and <i>Getting Over It</i>, with movement mechanics inspired by <i>Celeste</i>, this 2D adventure will push you to your limits, one frustratingly rewarding grapple at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reach the top of the mountain using only your grappling hook, double jump, and dash. Sounds simple, right? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Grappling Hook</strong>: Use your grappling hook to swing yourself across gaps and terrain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Double Jump &amp; Dash</strong>: Combine your jumps and dashes to create fluid, skill-based movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Difficult</strong>: The higher you climb, the more intense the challenge becomes. A single mistake could send you plummeting back to the bottom\u2014so stay focused!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Beautiful but Unforgiving Areas</strong>: Traverse different biomes, from forests to icy peaks, each with its own unique hazards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiplayer Ghosts</strong>: Race your friends asynchronously up the mountain by importing their ghosts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Secret Area</strong>: For the truly skilled, who reach the summit at blazing speed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you conquer the mountain, or will gravity get the best of you? The summit is waiting\u2014if you can survive the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298230/extras/grapplegif.gif?t=1743548403\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Reached The Castle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3298230/1a475c216bf8729835fef4e46883807fca0730e0.jpg"},{"name":"Reached The Mountain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3298230/85ac9237d1876c41413cf7d6d5de275dcb21f8df.jpg"},{"name":"Reached The Cave","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3298230/8e1ab481256b7b3304002b764f9ca32aeb3211fb.jpg"},{"name":"Reached The Summit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3298230/a19778bb23a4c972c808146f220d357d0ab49a98.jpg"},{"name":"Reached The Ruins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3298230/99bfb7011823f508035a4535d9fa2301ed6e1e05.jpg"},{"name":"Found The Heart of the Mountain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3298230/2ec0e40532001d8aa1cf0b1d71bd445934732685.jpg"},{"name":"Survived The Mountain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3298230/f55b94a4cfe294e627ede199be7194f5cfec820e.jpg"},{"name":"Climbed The Mountain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3298230/6c22170c80d1b4fb6e4896241ddbe4875c531229.jpg"},{"name":"Conquered The Mountain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3298230/69b451ac7ea93799ba78c41582d1e39d028a98c5.jpg"},{"name":"Mountain Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3298230/b7aa247124a4c80ca2be93abbb6ce953c