elf across gaps and terrain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Double Jump &amp; Dash</strong>: Combine your jumps and dashes to create fluid, skill-based movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Difficult</strong>: The higher you climb, the more intense the challenge becomes. A single mistake could send you plummeting back to the bottom\u2014so stay focused!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Beautiful but Unforgiving Areas</strong>: Traverse different biomes, from forests to icy peaks, each with its own unique hazards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiplayer Ghosts</strong>: Race your friends asynchronously up the mountain by importing their ghosts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Secret Area</strong>: For the truly skilled, who reach the summit at blazing speed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you conquer the mountain, or will gravity get the best of you? The summit is waiting\u2014if you can survive the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298230/extras/grapplegif.gif?t=1743548403\" /></p>","developers":["KO Productions"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298230/header.jpg?t=1743548403","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257101229,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101229/movie480.mp4?t=1740284984","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101229/movie_max.mp4?t=1740284984"},"name":"Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257101229/2fe53a196757bf14545dda94dd58054aab354abd/movie_600x337.jpg